{"subject":"Do not submit claim C021609 - duplicate of C008546","body":"Hi billing lead,

Please do not submit claim C021609 (patient PT0214, service code T1005, date of service 2026-10-13, 8 units, $38.40). The same member, service and date were already billed as C008546, and the payer's pre-check predicts a denial as a duplicate (D05). The claim cannot be fixed by editing it, so it should be held rather than corrected.

Could you confirm once it has been removed from the submission queue? It is currently scheduled for submission on 2026-11-28, so please confirm before that date."}
